AWARDS AND PRESENTATIONS

7.. Mayor Posey to present commendations to members of the Air Traffic Noise Working Group to thank them for their participation.  -  Action: received and filed {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\fs24 Members present to accept their commendation were Michael Bourgeault, Phil Burtis, Chris Kunze, Jeff Morin, Ed Mountford, Dave Porter, Gordon Smith and Mario Tabernig.\par
}


8.. Mayor Posey to call on representatives from Orange County Transportation Authority (OCTA) to introduce the on-demand pilot program called “OC Flex.”  -  Action: received and filed {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\fs24 Johnny Dunning, Jr, Department Manager, Scheduling and Customer Advocacy, Orange County Transportation Authority (OCTA),  presented a PowerPoint communication (Need PPT) entitled OC Flex , with slides titled:  OC Flex &mdash; Service Background, OC Flex &mdash; On Demand Service, OC Flex &mdash; Vehicles, OC Flex &mdash; Fares, Marketing Strategies/Tactics, and Next Steps.\par
\par
Councilmembers and Mr. Dunning discussed several details about the program such as expected wait times, seat belts for all passengers, fees, age limit of 13 to ride without an adult, and how this area was selected for the pilot program.\par
}


9.. Mayor Posey to call on members of the Huntington Beach Police Officers' Foundation who will present a check from the Constable Classic Charity Golf Tournament to representatives from Talk About Curing Autism (TACA).  -  Action: received and filed {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\fs24\par
